# Image assets directory

## Sources for Robotics Images

Use these royalty-free sources:

1. **Unsplash** (free, high quality):
   - https://unsplash.com/s/photos/robot
   - https://unsplash.com/s/photos/humanoid-robot
   - https://unsplash.com/s/photos/quadruped-robot
   - https://unsplash.com/s/photos/space-robotics

2. **Pexels** (free, commercial use):
   - https://www.pexels.com/search/robot/
   - https://www.pexels.com/search/robotics/

3. **NASA Images** (public domain):
   - https://images.nasa.gov/search-results?q=robot
   - https://images.nasa.gov/search-results?q=mars%20rover

4. **Pixabay** (free):
   - https://pixabay.com/images/search/robot/

## Required Images

- `hero-bg.jpg` (1920x1080) - Humanoid robot or robotic arm
- `texas-bg.jpg` (1920x1080) - Austin skyline or UT Tower
- `space-bg.jpg` (1920x1080) - Space robotics or Mars rover
- `og-image.jpg` (1200x630) - Social sharing image
- `robot-1.jpg` through `robot-8.jpg` - Research track images
